Third-party components
----------------------
The shesha-daemon binary links FFTW, which is GPL-2.0-or-later (or
commercially licensed). Distributed binaries that include FFTW are therefore
GPL-2.0-or-later. The source for those binaries is this repository, and
FFTW's source is available at https://fftw.org/.

The OUI vendor table in client/shesha/oui.py is generated from Wireshark's
manuf data, which is GPL-2.0-or-later. That data table is distributed under
the same license; the rest of shesha remains MIT. See README.md for details.
